# Arus Finance V27 — canonical Git normalization.
# Keep repository object identity stable across Windows/macOS/Linux checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary/archive formats must never be newline-normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.p12 binary
*.mobileprovision binary
